// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/t27f/work_view_rules.t27 -- the object rules of the T27F view factory for the actor model.
; viz_select.t27 decides WHICH views a composition holds, from the intent and the shape of the
; data, and never looks at what kind of object a node is. This spec is the level below it, the
; owner's unit of development of 2026-11-03 ("the rule that turns an object into a
; representation"), for the one actor model, work_graph.t27:
;   wv_shape    a WorkGraph -> the VizShape viz_select reads (counts, the largest fan-out, a time
;               axis, a numeric load, unknown provenance), computed from the graph, never typed in.
;   wv_rule     object kind x intent -> the reps that kind prefers, in rank order: the rule table.
;   wv_mark     object kind x rep -> how an object of that kind is drawn inside that rep (a node, a
;               row, a lane, a tick, a bar, counted into a bar, the inspector's detail), or not at all.
;   wv_home     resolves the rule against the composition viz_select picked: the first preferred rep
;               the composition holds is where the object lives and where a selection of it lands.
;   wv_members  every rep of the composition that draws the kind: one object, several views.
;   wv_load     the number a bar shows: the actions an agent performs (PERFORMS edges).
; --
; THE RULES (each with a test below):
;   - the table is closed: every rep a rule names can draw that kind (wv_mark is not NONE), and
;     every kind has a rank-0 rep under every actor intent.
;   - a kind whose preferred reps are all missing from the composition is UNPLACED, never pushed
;     into a rep that cannot draw it; a refused composition places nothing (WV_REF_PICK).
;   - only the three intents of frontend.t27 that are about the actors' work hold rules:
;     I_LIVE_AGENT, I_HEALTH, I_REPORT. Any other intent is WV_REF_INTENT, not a guess.
;   - an ACTION in a chart is COUNTED into its performer's bar, so the bars sum to the PERFORMS
;     edge count: every action is counted once, none is drawn twice.
;   - has_time comes from ACTION nodes (an action's id is its bus seq, the order of the feed);
;     has_numeric from PERFORMS edges; any_unknown from node provenance. The request knobs
;     wants_path and pairwise stay 0: the caller sets them, the graph cannot know them.
; --
; Determinism: the same graph and intent give the same shape, the same pick and the same places,
; every call; fixed preference order, no clock, no randomness, integers only.
; --
; Not claimed: no petal calls this yet; the preferences are policy decided here, not measurements;
; no mark is drawn here (hud.t27 and spec_scene.t27 are the scene producers); VIZ_REP_MATRIX,
; TRACE, SOURCE, MAP, TEXT and the controls draw no actor-model kind in this table.
; ASCII only (L3). phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module T27fWorkViewRules;

